(card "exp:H-R3a-2_d_r2_3_sizing" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R3a-2_d_r2_3_sizing"
  :body "---\nnav: 10\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R3a-2\nshort_name: d_r2_3_sizing\ntitle: \"H-R3a-2 — D-R2-3 × clip(ratio/median, 0.5, 1.5)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r3a\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.7719\ntrain_trade_count: 171\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8187\ntrain_sharpe: 6.5505\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0083\nval_nav_mean: 1.0769\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0824\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.1745\ntest_trade_count: 18\ntest_sharpe: 4.9752\ntest_win_rate: 0.7222\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0063\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r3a, axis/sizing, axis/blacklist, status/falsified, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R3a-2 — D-R2-3 base × ratio/median sizing\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R3a 是 H 队\"切到 D 系列 blacklist base\"的尝试。train NAV 2.77 vs 同 sizing on C8.4 (R2-2) 的 3.65，差 0.9；**test NAV 1.17 < anchor 1.25** —— **被证伪**，与 [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] 在 hold-out 上的崩塌同源。H 队据此决定**放弃 D base**，专注 C8.4 base 走 R3b。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 用 D-R2-3 (default-admit + 3-stack blacklist) 作 trade selector，叠 ratio/median sizing。\n- 假设：D 队的 blacklist 选出的 171 笔与 C8.4 的 179 笔有 base alpha density 相近 → sizing 应当能放大同样幅度。\n- 实测：D-R2-3 base 在 train 已弱于 C8.4 base（D 队 D-R2-3 train 2.42 vs C8.4 3.15），sizing 加成后差距保持；test 上 D-base 直接崩盘。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_3a_runner.py`\n- trade selector = D-R2-3：default admit ∖ {lc_48h==2 ∪ open_3min ∪ low pre_amt q10}\n- sizing：与 H-R2-2 同公式 `clip(ratio/median, 0.5, 1.5)`\n- mean_size = 1.080.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median`，strict past-only，warmup=10。\n- D-R2-3 本身的 lc_48h / pre_avg quantile 都已 strict past-only（D 队 audit pass）。\n- `#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.7719 | 171 | 6.55 | 81.9% | -0.83% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0769 ± 0.082 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | **1.1745** | 18 | **4.98** | 72.2% | -0.63% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.074 (FAIL)** | -2 | -2.17 | -2.8pp | -0.10pp |\n\n注意 test_sharpe 4.98 是 H 系列最低，与 D-R2-3 test崩盘 (sharpe 4.79) 同步。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0（gate 都过），但 test 直接崩 —— **同 [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] 的 train/test 分布漂移问题**。\n- sizing 没法救 D base 的 hold-out 弱化。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-1__rolling_30d_median_solo]]\n- **builds on**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] (D base)\n- **inherits_failure_mode**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] (test崩盘同源)\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]] (同 sizing on C8.4)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3a-1__b_r11_2_sizing]] (R3a 另一档, B-R11-2 base)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R3a-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **关键 lesson**：sizing axis 不能补 base trade selector 的 train→test 不稳定。如果 base 本身 hold-out 失败，sizing 只会同步失败。\n- H 队 R3a 砍掉 D base / B base 路线，专注 C8.4 → 是正确决定。下次 sizing arc 优先用 hold-out test 稳定的 base，不是 train NAV 高的 base。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3a-2__d_r2_3_sizing.md"
